WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.401
Tomorrow is my sixth birthday.

2
00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:12.307
I want a big birthday party.

3
00:00:12.308 --> 00:00:18.892
I want a birthday party at the roller rink. "Whee!"

4
00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:25.757
I want a birthday party with lots of balloons.

5
00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:30.383
"Pop! Pop! Pop!"

6
00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:35.409
I want a birthday party with lots of presents.

7
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:40.549
"Wow, thanks!"

8
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:46.640
I want a birthday party with lots of games.

9
00:00:46.641 --> 00:00:49.588
"I win!"

10
00:00:49.589 --> 00:00:55.707
I want a birthday party with lots of pizza.

11
00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:59.661
"I love pizza!"

12
00:00:59.662 --> 00:01:07.039
I want a birthday party with lots of ice cream.

13
00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:10.212
"Yummy!"

14
00:01:10.213 --> 00:01:13.512
I can't wait until tomorrow!

15
00:01:13.513 --> 00:01:20.262
It will be lots of fun!

